{"_id":"hl9nBFBEvWuBWous","name":"Force Bolt","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell creates a bolt of power (duh) that can be flung magically at a single target. Another skill roll must be made, opposed by the target’s Dodge skill to cause damage. If successful the power bolt causes [[/roll 2d6]] damage.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"7bokZDSUsu8IHFwp","name":"Force Burst","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell creates a large ball of power that can be launched at a group of enemies. It will inflict [[/roll 1d6]] damage to all creatures (friend and foe alike) in a specific zone. Targets may make an Endurance skill test to take half damage.</p>","staminaCost":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"V8CnIJeEAlUNfhcP","name":"Luck Bolt","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell launches a bolt of chaos at a target, reducing their Luck score by [[/roll 1d6]]. A to hit roll must be made, opposed by the target's Dodge skill. Creatures without Luck score suffer [[/roll 2d6+2]] Stamina damage and are stunned for one round.</p>","staminaCost":6},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"XAFd5GWv3CA9tJl1","name":"Luck Burst","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell launches a ball of chaos at a specified zone. All creatures in the zone suffer a loss of [[/roll 1d3]] Luck. Creatures without a Luck score suffer [[/roll 1d6+1]] damage and are stunned for one round.</p>","staminaCost":8},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"CfHGeHqCJXmfenru","name":"Pull","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell moves the target one zone closer to the caster.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"SoCy7yyumulGDs6i","name":"Ram","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell moves the target one zone away from the caster.</p>","staminaCost":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":500,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"XOlgxsAWoRbSamv1","name":"Sleep","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Thai spell drops a target into a deep sleep for [[/roll 1d6]] minutes. The caster must touch the target, which in combat, requires a successful melee attack. When the target awakens it will have no idea what happened.</p>","staminaCost":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"LRn3G6Pa1rE2Xz4g","name":"Clairaudience","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to magically hear anything as if he were in the same room. The distance is usually nearby, such as a few rooms away. The caster could place this spell in advance, however, to hear into the location of the casting at nearly any distance away.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"IgKKfu2QQkMXMk5s","name":"Clairvoyance","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to magically see anything as if he were in the same room. The distance is usually nearby, such as a few rooms away. The caster could place this spell in advance, however, to see into the location of the casting at nearly any distance away.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"sttuuoQfnBDV0Cdj","name":"Combat Sense","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to ignore penalties to combat for close range ranged attacks or firing at characters in melee.</p>","staminaCost":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":900,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"pfDYaqefLa8SEAG8","name":"Detect Enemies","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to detect any creatures in nearby range that have hostile intent. Range is determined by the game master depending on the scenario.</p>","staminaCost":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"wmBIKgLcqn0ElXEK","name":"Detect Individual","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to detect an individual person or creature whom he is relatively familiar with. The range is roughly a city block. If the caster has only seen a picture or video of the person there is a -5 penalty to the Sorcery roll.</p>","staminaCost":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"zx0Uu9XsDm0HO3mi","name":"Detect Life","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to detect any life, even spirits or invisible creatures in the immediate area.</p>","staminaCost":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"x928uZDx5H54Thzd","name":"Mind Probe","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to pull information from a subdued creature against their will. The target may roll a Persuasion check with a -5 penalty to resist.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"rEPaSpdecDZsOiCk","name":"Antidote","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell will remove any lingering effects of poison from the target, that must be touched.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"cLpkgEIZUeipJ4IR","name":"Cure","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell will remove any normal minor disease from the target, that must be touched.</p>","staminaCost":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1500,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Sf8IY38NglJlzGeB","name":"Heal","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to heal [[/roll 1d6+3]] stamina either to themselves or to allies. The spell may be cast in combat, but the caster must be touching the target for the spell to have any effect. INCREASED REFLEXES (4, 6, 8) The target of this spell gains the effect of Wired Reflexes at the next highest level. Multiple castings can stack the results but requires more Stamina. 4 for Level 1 Wired Reflexes, 6 for Level 2, 8 for Level 3. The effects last for one combat. This spell can be cast in advance but the Stamina drain does not heal until the ability is used.</p>","staminaCost":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"6TSoyrct67KHb05b","name":"Increase Skill","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Increase a specific skill for one character by [[/roll 1d6]].</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"QbRMqx49KSnxuL7n","name":"Confusion","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell befuddles all enemies in nearby range. Those affected suffer a -3 to all tests due to the confusion for [[/roll 1d6]] rounds.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"DkDjbtpF5LHdWw21","name":"Illusion","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>With this spell the caster is able to create an illusion that tricks the eyes of those that see it. The illusion has the maximum dimensions of a table and lasts [[/roll 1d6]] rounds. If the caster does nothing else they may make the illusion move and create sound. Various enhanced and cyber eyes and ears may negate this spell.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1900,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"W6mxPXYn00jF3t0X","name":"Stink","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>When cast this spell creates a stench from beyond the grave so foul that any being, friend or foe, within nearby range loses [[/roll 1d6]] stamina. Only the caster is blissfully resistant to the hideous miasma.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"jPhSYv4zw7ugmEQx","name":"Levitate","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The caster may rise up to 10 feet in the air. The spell lasts for up to [[/roll 1d6]] rounds, after which the caster drifts back down again.</p>","staminaCost":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"qavE7E4pesnWNywD","name":"Telekinesis","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster to magically move a dog-sized object within line of sight. The spell lasts for [[/roll 2d6]] combat rounds.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"UDB6nHWkRHBQDpKL","name":"Armour","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The caster creates a suit of magical Armour that takes a specified appearance (chainmail, riot gear, etc). This Armour has a rating of [[/roll 2d6]].</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"DbRHQI3u90OxjWVU","name":"Mana Barrier","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell creates a psychic protection field around the caster’s mind. No mind or Luck affecting spells may harm him for [[/roll 2d6]] rounds. An almost necessity in magical combat.</p>","staminaCost":5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"pcVkBxiEASx37pYb","name":"Darkness","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>When this spell is cast, a zone of the blackest night expands around the caster and all those in nearby range. Only the caster and those creatures that can see in pitch black are unaffected. From the outside the spell resembles a cloud of seething darkness.</p>","staminaCost":4},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2500,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"VLYIc7SzpzUGzgbk","name":"Low-Light Vision","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Allows the caster or touched creature to see normally in low-light or non-magical darkness. Lasts one combat or scene.</p>","staminaCost":2},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Mzn9fK6dyMHwepX7","name":"Darkvision","type":"Spell","img":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/items/spells/wind-hole.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This spell allows the caster or touched creature to see in magical darkness. Lasts one combat or scene.</p>","staminaCost":3},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
